      "content": "everything is just so quiet now. i keep waiting to hear him trot across the floor or hear his collar jingle but it never happens. it just feels like the house is empty and i'm just... existing in a void. it feels so stupid to be this devastated over a dog but i dont know what else to do with all this emptiness. everything feels pointless.",
