      "content": "but \"moving forward\" to what? just more silence? more days where nothing actually matters? i feel like i'm just going through the motions of a life that doesn't even feel like mine anymore. people say it gets better but right now it just feels like everything is fundamentally broken and there's no point in trying to fix it.",
